---Creates a Particle Emitter that emits particles
---
---The color and size of a particle is interpolated linearly from start to finish based on the end color and ending size multiplier parameters respectively
---@param x number X position of the particle emitter.
---@param y number Y position of the particle emitter.
---@param z number Z position of the particle emitter.
---@param emitter_duration number The duration of the particle emitter in seconds.
---@param emitter_frequency number How often particles are emitted from the particle emitter in milliseconds.
---@param particle_duration number The duration of an emitted particle in seconds up to maximum of `8` seconds.
---@param velocity_x number X velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second.
---@param velocity_y number Y velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second.
---@param velociy_z number Z velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second.
---@param size_x number X size of an emitted particle. `1` is the size of a full block.
---@param size_y number Y size of an emitted particle. `1` is the size of a full block.
---@param size_z number Z size of an emitted particle. `1` is the size of a full block.
---@param ending_size_multiplier number The size multiplier of an emitted particle at the end of its life. The particle's size tweens linearly into the size multiplier throughout its entire lifetime.
---@param start_color_r? integer How red an emitted particle should start at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param start_color_g? integer How green an emitted particle should start at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param start_color_b? integer How blue an emitted particle should start at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param start_color_a? integer How transparent (or the alpha) an emitted particle should start at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param gravity? number The amount of Y velocity subtracted per second. Omit for `0` gravity.
---@param rotation? number The Y axis rotation per second in radians. Omit for `0` rotation.
---@param velocity_var_x? number Variable X velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param velocity_var_y? number Variable Y velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param velocity_var_z? number Variable Z velocity of an emitted particle in blocks per second. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param end_color_r? integer How red an emitted particle should end at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param end_color_g? integer How green an emitted particle should end at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param end_color_b? integer How blue an emitted particle should end at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param end_color_a? integer How transparent (or the alpha) an emitted particle should end at a number between `0` to `255`. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_var_x? number Variable X position of an emitted particle. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_var_y? number Variable Y position of an emitted particle. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_var_z? number Variable Z position of an emitted particle. Variability is either added or subtracted and is varied from `0` to the number provided. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_offset_x? number X offset position of an emitted particle. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_offset_y? number Y offset position of an emitted particle. Omit for `0`.
---@param emit_pos_offset_z? number Z offset position of an emitted particle. Omit for `0`.
function add_particle_emitter(x, y, z, emitter_duration, emitter_frequency, particle_duration, velocity_x, velocity_y, velociy_z, size_x, size_y, size_z, ending_size_multiplier, start_color_r, start_color_g, start_color_b, start_color_a, gravity, rotation, velocity_var_x, velocity_var_y, velocity_var_z, end_color_r, end_color_g, end_color_b, end_color_a, emit_pos_var_x, emit_pos_var_y,  emit_pos_var_z, emit_pos_offset_x, emit_pos_offset_y, emit_pos_offset_z) end